values ('c7d8e9f0-1a2b-4d17-8e67-7f8a9b0c1d77', 'human-evolution', 'Human Evolution', 'Human Evolution is a rigorous upper-division anthropology course on the origin, diversification, and continuing evolution of humans and our close relatives. The course integrates fossil morphology, archaeology, primate behavior, evolutionary theory, paleoecology, genetics, genomics, and ethical research practice. Students learn to evaluate evidence, compare competing models, and communicate human origins without linear-progress myths, biological race errors, or sensationalism.');

